WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.530
 What's up, Marvel fans?

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:02.850
I'm joined by Paula Newsome.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.790
How's it going?

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:04.630
 It's going great.

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.000
This is terribly exciting.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.200
INTERVIEWER: You
know, we don't know

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.850
too much about your character.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.113
What's it like joining the MCU?

00:00:10.113 --> 00:00:11.580
 You know what I'm
going to tell you that--

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.870
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.330
--when Twitter started,
kind of, going agog,

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.520
they thought I was MJ's mama.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:18.570
Not to say that I'm not.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:19.860
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:22.800
But what's really fun about
this is joining this--

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.460
it's like coming into halftime
when the-- when the game is

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.830
already going and you jump in.

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:28.980
And it's like, I got to keep up.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:29.850
I got to keep up.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:30.690
I got to keep up.

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:31.840
It's fabulous.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.015
 Well, I bet you did amazing.

00:00:33.015 --> 00:00:33.815
 Thank you.

00:00:33.815 --> 00:00:36.960
 So everyone knows that
Peter Parker is Spider-Man.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.985
How does your character
feel about that?

00:00:38.985 --> 00:00:41.730
 You know, she's not
so enthused by him.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.810
I'm not going to
give away too much.

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.220
INTERVIEWER: And that's the tea.

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:48.020
 That's true.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.230
She doesn't much
like him that much

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:51.150
because he's not impressed.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.050
I mean, what do you got?

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:53.370
What do you got?

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:55.545
 Whoa.

00:00:55.545 --> 00:00:56.500
I-- I'm taking that.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.300
I'm going to keep--

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.400
I'm going to hold that while
I go into the theaters.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.770
What are you excited
to see tonight?

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.810
 I'm excited to see the
movie in its entirety.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:06.520
Jon Watts, our
director, is amazing.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.640
I got to work with an
amazing group of actors,

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:11.850
Fred Molina, Tom, you know.

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:14.940
We were there for a month in
the middle of Atlanta, just--

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:15.740
[LAUGHTER]

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:17.190
--and along with
my stunt double.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.920
It was just-- I look forward
to seeing the whole thing.

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:23.610
You know, the whole
multiverse vibe, come on now.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:25.800
 I mean, you chose a
great time to show up.

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:26.860
I'm just saying.

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:28.380
Well, I don't want to keep you.

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:30.210
You have the rest of
the red carpet to go.

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.540
And-- and enjoy the film.

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:32.580
Congratulations again.

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:33.380
 Thanks, love.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:36.170
[MUSIC PLAYING]

